---
// v2/src/components/oriel/Safety.astro
---
<section aria-labelledby="safety-title" class="bg-sand" id="safety"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28"><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10"><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 lg:col-span-7" style="transition-delay:0ms"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember-deep">Safety and privacy</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-heading text-[clamp(2.6rem,5.4vw,5rem)] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.02em]" id="safety-title">Soft, slow, and <em class="italic text-ember-deep">always listening for stop.</em></h2></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex items-end lg:col-span-5" style="transition-delay:150ms"><p class="max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A robot that shares your hallway has to be gentle before it is clever. These limits are built into the hardware, not added as settings.</p></div></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/10 sm:grid-cols-2 md:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="bg-sand"><div class="ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-background/60 md:p-9" style="transition-delay:0ms"><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-foreground text-background"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-[1.9rem] leading-tight">Yields on contact</h3><p class="max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Force-limited joints soften the instant they meet unexpected resistance, and stop within 50 ms.</p></div></li><li class="bg-sand"><div class="ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-background/60 md:p-9" style="transition-delay:70ms"><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-foreground text-background"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-gauge size-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m12 14 4-4"></path><path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-[1.9rem] leading-tight">Walks at a human pace</h3><p class="max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Speed is capped indoors, and lower still near children, pets and stairs.</p></div></li><li class="bg-sand"><div class="ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-background/60 md:p-9" style="transition-delay:140ms"><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-foreground text-background"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-eye-off size-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10.733 5.076a10.744 10.744 0 0 1 11.205 6.575 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.747 10.747 0 0 1-1.444 2.49"></path><path d="M14.084 14.158a3 3 0 0 1-4.242-4.242"></path><path d="M17.479 17.499a10.75 10.75 0 0 1-15.417-5.151 1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 4.446-5.143"></path><path d="m2 2 20 20"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-[1.9rem] leading-tight">Private by design</h3><p class="max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Vision and voice are processed on board. A physical shutter closes the cameras whenever you like.</p></div></li><li class="bg-sand"><div class="ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-background/60 md:p-9" style="transition-delay:210ms"><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-foreground text-background"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-hand size-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M18 11V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M14 10V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"></path><path d="M10 10.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8"></path><path d="M18 8a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v6a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-2c-2.8 0-4.5-.86-5.99-2.34l-3.6-3.6a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.82L7 15"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-[1.9rem] leading-tight">Asks before it acts</h3><p class="max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Unfamiliar objects, closed doors and new chores all get a question first.</p></div></li><li class="bg-sand"><div class="ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-background/60 md:p-9" style="transition-delay:280ms"><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-foreground text-background"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-power size-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 2v10"></path><path d="M18.4 6.6a9 9 0 1 1-12.77.04"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-[1.9rem] leading-tight">Stops on a word</h3><p class="max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Say “Oriel, stop”, press the button between its shoulders, or tap stop in the app.</p></div></li><li class="bg-sand"><div class="ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-background/60 md:p-9" style="transition-delay:350ms"><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-foreground text-background"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-headset size-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M3 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5Zm0 0a9 9 0 1 1 18 0m0 0v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3Z"></path><path d="M21 16v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-5"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-[1.9rem] leading-tight">Expert help, only with you</h3><p class="max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">For a job it hasn’t learned, a trained specialist can guide it remotely, only in a session you approve.</p></div></li></ul></div></section>